1
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,719
How are you doing? Want to take a break?

2
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,680
I'm fine.

3
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,480
I think you were right earlier.

4
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,200
We all need to move forward.

5
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:10,759
I think I can.

6
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,400
Helen, you're really brave.

7
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:15,560
You not only accepted reality,

8
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,000
but also joined Zhong An.

9
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,719
You even volunteer every year

10
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,319
to provide security for the support group.

11
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,560
I believe we'll definitely

12
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:26,159
step out of the shadows together.

13
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,520
Actually, you know what?

14
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,680
The reason I joined Zhong An

15
00:02:34,879 --> 00:02:37,120
was to protect innocent people

16
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,319
from senseless harm.

17
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:42,000
When danger comes,

18
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:45,680
I want to use my own strength

19
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,319
to protect the ones I love.

20
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,879
Hello, Professor Park.

21
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:00,719
Hello. Hello.

22
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,039
Professor Park.

23
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:02,639
Hello.

24
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:03,479
Hello, hello.

25
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,479
It's wonderful to finally meet you.

26
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,599
Hello, Professor Park.

27
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,280
Hello, hello.

28
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:07,879
Hello.

29
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,360
Professor Park, for lunch today,

30
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,000
we've booked the best restaurant around.

31
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,120
Please do us the honor of joining us.

32
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,039
I've heard for a while now

33
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,280
that this hotel's buffet

34
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,680
is really quite delicious.

35
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,719
But unfortunately,

36
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,680
I'd like to attend a support group at noon,

37
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,199
so I'm afraid I'll have to pass.

38
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,520
That's too bad.

39
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,120
You're not a family member, are you?

40
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:34,080
I heard about what they went through,

41
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,319
and I'd like to offer some encouragement.

42
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,479
Please.

43
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,000
Let's go.

44
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:41,439
Let's go.

45
00:04:41,439 --> 00:04:42,120
Okay.

46
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:15,519
Those two men

47
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:17,279
and the security for

48
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,720
that support group or whatever...

49
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:21,720
Even though their security level is low,

50
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:25,199
we still can't let our guard down.

51
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,000
Got that?

52
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:36,519
Are you sure there are no other guards?

53
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:37,759
There shouldn't be.

54
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:41,879
The support group and the history symposium

55
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,560
are booked at the same hotel.

56
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,680
It's probably just a coincidence.

57
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,120
We still need to be careful.

58
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,839
This time, that Korean

59
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:50,759
found out our ruins are fake.

60
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:52,360
This must be a setup.

61
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,680
How could he have uncovered our secret?

62
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,279
This time,

63
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:58,279
we must kill that Korean.

64
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:59,600
Give them a warning,

65
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,600
and let the whole world know

66
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:04,120
what happens when you break our taboo.

67
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,600
This woman is a bit suspicious.

68
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,560
Go check her room right now.

69
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:13,800
Pay special attention to her luggage,

70
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,680
and see what's inside.

71
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:19,040
Okay, got it.

72
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,279
I'll go check right away.

73
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,120
Dongliang, where are you?

74
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,639
There's some movement on the second floor.

75
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:34,600
Come check it out.

76
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:35,639
Copy that.

77
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,560
Dongliang, where are you?

78
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,120
Just finished patrolling the second floor.

79
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,120
I'm here too.

80
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,959
This hotel is such a maze.

81
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,560
If I hadn't done my homework beforehand,

82
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,759
I would've gotten totally lost.

83
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,199
Listen, what's that noise?

84
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,000
Just the band rehearsing.

85
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,360
No, I've got to check it out.

86
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:09,959
I saw the band guys this afternoon.

87
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:11,759
What's there to see at a rehearsal?

88
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,800
Their posters are all over the place.

89
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,519
Watch them at the bar tonight if you want.

90
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:16,120
Let's go. Business comes first.

91
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,120
Darkness has fallen. Move.

92
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,800
Nobody move!

93
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,560
Get down over there!

94
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:27,920
Get down!

95
00:09:17,279 --> 00:09:18,720
On this very day a few years ago,

96
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,799
Yanyan hadn't been born yet.

97
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:22,720
Not being able to let my child

98
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,600
see her father one last time

99
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,320
has been the biggest

100
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:30,919
regret of my life.

101
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:34,200
Helen, it's almost your turn to speak.

102
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,320
Where are you right now?

103
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,679
I just want some time alone.

104
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,919
Even after all these years,

105
00:09:40,879 --> 00:09:42,519
and helping other families

106
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:45,559
heal from the pain of losing loved ones,

107
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:49,080
I still feel I can't face it.

108
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,279
Come on, don't grieve all by yourself.

109
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:53,279
Hurry on over.

110
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,679
Everyone's waiting.

111
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,440
Got it.

112
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,720
This year in historical research,

113
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,759
the most astonishing discovery

114
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:06,919
is identifying Alakatuni's tomb.

115
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:09,720
Professor Park An-soon of Chung-Ang Univ.

116
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:11,960
conducted a scientific examination

117
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,720
of Alakatuni's remains.

118
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,679
This is a new breakthrough

119
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:17,960
in radioactive isotope

120
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,320
half-life detection methods.

121
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:21,559
By using a genuine artifact

122
00:10:21,679 --> 00:10:22,720
from a tomb of the same era,

123
00:10:22,759 --> 00:10:25,080
he discovered this tomb was actually a fake.

124
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:28,519
The tomb was forged in the last century.

125
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,519
Get down!

126
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:37,320
Down!

127
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:40,919
Thank you all so much for being here.

128
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,559
Thanks to your help and support,

129
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,320
I found the courage

130
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:47,039
to bring Yanyan into this world.

131
00:10:47,039 --> 00:10:48,960
Most of all, I want to thank Yanyan.

132
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:53,320
Her presence in my life all these years

133
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,159
gave me the strength

134
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,879
to keep on living.

135
00:10:58,799 --> 00:11:00,960
Yanyan is starting elementary school soon.

136
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:02,799
I want to give her and myself

137
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:04,519
a brand new start.

138
00:11:04,879 --> 00:11:06,759
We've talked it over.

139
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:10,000
Today is our last time

140
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,320
attending this support group.

141
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:22,320
Thank you all so much

142
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:23,919
for standing by me all these years.

143
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,720
Just like that.

144
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,919
I just love quiet.

145
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,759
A nice, quiet atmosphere.

146
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,919
That's how I can think.

147
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,799
Let's play a game.

148
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:39,960
Whoever's name I call,

149
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,080
stand up and repeat

150
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,279
your own name.

151
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,720
Then get back down.

152
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,080
Did I make myself clear?

153
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:49,879
Anyone who doesn't stand gets shot dead.

154
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,399
Let the game begin.

155
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,799
Park An-soon.

156
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:07,080
Park An-soon!

157
00:12:11,639 --> 00:12:13,240
Who knows where Park An-soon is?

158
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,399
Where did he go?

159
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,720
Gunshot. I'll check it out.

160
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,960
Alert Helen right away.

161
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,080
Something seems wrong at the hotel.

162
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:24,399
I'm going with you.

163
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,559
Okay.

164
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,919
Control room, heads up.

165
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:33,279
Park An-soon isn't here.

166
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,519
Copy that. Secure the conference room.

167
00:12:36,879 --> 00:12:38,320
Search the other areas.

168
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:34,159
Armed intruders infiltrated the hotel.

169
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:36,320
Seems the gunshots you heard were real.

170
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,960
Head back to the function hall first.

171
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,080
Keep the support group's families safe.

172
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:06,080
Don't move! Freeze! Don't move!

173
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:10,320
Don't move!

174
00:15:10,639 --> 00:15:11,440
Stay still!

175
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:14,919
Shut up if you want to live!

176
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,279
Everybody, get down!

177
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,799
Get over there! Move!

178
00:15:24,799 --> 00:15:25,440
Get up!

179
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,279
Don't kill me!

180
00:15:26,279 --> 00:15:27,000
Move it!

181
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,279
If you want to live, get over there!

182
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:30,320
Over there!

183
00:15:31,279 --> 00:15:32,080
Don't kill me!

184
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:33,759
Be quiet!

185
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,000
Please don't kill me!

186
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,720
Hurry up!

187
00:15:37,559 --> 00:15:38,360
Move!

188
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,039
Get down!

189
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,080
Quick!

190
00:15:42,519 --> 00:15:43,320
Get down!

191
00:15:49,879 --> 00:15:51,639
Begin a full sweep.

192
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:54,440
Don't miss a single room.

193
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,000
Both venues

194
00:15:56,159 --> 00:15:58,480
are now under our control.

195
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:01,000
Target Number One was not found in either.

196
00:16:01,559 --> 00:16:03,639
If you meet any resistance,

197
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:05,639
shoot to kill.

198
00:16:21,519 --> 00:16:22,320
Don't move.

199
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,759
Go in.

200
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,399
Looks like they've already secured

201
00:16:52,399 --> 00:16:53,360
the support group's venue.

202
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,200
Let's call the police first.

203
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,440
Let's wait until Helen gets here.

204
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,279
Is this the police?

205
00:17:02,639 --> 00:17:03,919
Hostages are being held here.

206
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:04,920
Requesting backup.

207
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,640
What's the situation inside?

208
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,759
They've been looking for someone.

209
00:17:34,759 --> 00:17:36,000
Looks like there are already casualties.

210
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,200
I doubt there are hostiles inside.

211
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,240
I already called the police.

212
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,720
Seems the casualty count is still unclear.

213
00:17:40,799 --> 00:17:41,880
We have to go in and check.

214
00:17:42,039 --> 00:17:42,920
Let's focus on saving people first.

215
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,119
Listen to me, everyone. Keep quiet.

216
00:17:48,119 --> 00:17:49,000
Stay still.

217
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:50,720
Or you'll just attract more militants.

218
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,799
They have guns.

219
00:17:52,039 --> 00:17:54,119
Nobody move until the police arrive.

220
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,720
Who are they looking for?

221
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,240
If you want to live,

222
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,640
step forward right now.

223
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:04,039
Or else, not only will no one protect you,

224
00:18:04,359 --> 00:18:05,119
but everyone in this room

225
00:18:05,119 --> 00:18:06,519
will die because of you.

226
00:18:08,759 --> 00:18:10,799
You, come with me to the roof.

227
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,119
Only if you come to the roof with me

228
00:18:23,119 --> 00:18:24,240
will they be safe.

229
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:25,759
Don't worry.

230
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:26,960
I'm a Security Officer.

231
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,200
I won't let anything happen to you.

232
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,240
All right.

233
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:30,519
Give me the radio.

234
00:18:49,119 --> 00:18:49,920
Move in!

235
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:56,359
The target has appeared on the rooftop.

236
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,519
Send backup immediately.

237
00:19:06,519 --> 00:19:07,319
Come back!

238
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:28,240
Stay here. Don't move.

239
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,240
Okay.

240
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,119
Terrorists control the main meeting room.

241
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,640
We must find a way to rescue the hostages.

242
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,079
With our current manpower,

243
00:20:03,079 --> 00:20:04,680
a forced rescue will be very difficult.

244
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:05,880
In my experience,

245
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:07,000
in 15 minutes,

246
00:20:07,359 --> 00:20:10,039
the police will surround this hotel.

247
00:20:10,799 --> 00:20:12,400
As the terrorists retreat,

248
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,799
they'll use the hostages as human shields.

249
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,720
Listen up, you on the roof!

250
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,799
Come out and surrender right now!

251
00:20:23,039 --> 00:20:24,880
Every minute you delay,

252
00:20:25,079 --> 00:20:27,519
another person in this hotel will die!

253
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:29,880
Carry him away.

254
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,720
What do we do now?

255
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:44,480
I'll escort Prof. Park to the control room.

256
00:20:44,599 --> 00:20:45,720
You two head to the conference room.

257
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:46,599
Stay in contact.

258
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,680
Copy that.

259
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,279
One, two

260
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:09,160
Come on.

261
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:41,160
Where are the rest of our people?

262
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:42,759
You'll see them soon enough.

263
00:22:42,759 --> 00:22:43,640
What do you mean?

264
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,319
I'm in control of the surveillance room.

265
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:02,359
What's your status?

266
00:23:02,759 --> 00:23:04,599
The conference room perimeter is clear.

267
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:06,400
We're moving in to rescue the hostages.

268
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:08,160
Make sure the hostages stay safe.

269
00:23:08,599 --> 00:23:10,000
I'm on my way to back you up.

270
00:23:10,319 --> 00:23:11,119
Copy that.

271
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,480
Get up, get up.

272
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:07,359
Jianguo, Dongliang, great job!

273
00:24:08,599 --> 00:24:09,839
Don't be afraid, everyone. Don't panic.

274
00:24:09,839 --> 00:24:10,400
Thank you.

275
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:12,240
We've subdued the terrorists.

276
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:14,200
The police will be here shortly.

277
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,799
Everyone, please stand up.

278
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:19,680
Stand up, everyone.

279
00:24:20,519 --> 00:24:21,359
You're safe now.

280
00:24:29,799 --> 00:24:31,559
This incident happened so suddenly.

281
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:33,240
Fortunately, casualties were minimal.

282
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:35,559
We were attending an event at the time,

283
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,599
and the terrorists happened to

284
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,960
trap us inside the venue.

285
00:24:39,759 --> 00:24:41,240
Since it all happened so suddenly,

286
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:43,640
we had to think on our feet.

287
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:44,160
Helen.

288
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:44,480
Take it easy.

289
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:45,240
Thank you.

290
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,440
Hurry!

291
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:48,559
We truly owe it all to you guys.

292
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,200
Yanyan, don't be scared.

293
00:24:51,559 --> 00:24:53,000
The bad guys have been caught.

294
00:24:54,599 --> 00:24:55,839
It all happened so suddenly.

295
00:24:56,519 --> 00:24:58,240
Luckily, casualties weren't too heavy.

296
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,559
I thought terrorist attacks

297
00:25:00,559 --> 00:25:02,240
were far removed from our lives.

298
00:25:02,279 --> 00:25:04,839
I never expected we'd still face one.

299
00:25:05,839 --> 00:25:07,599
As long as different cultures exist,

300
00:25:07,799 --> 00:25:09,200
conflicts are inevitable.

301
00:25:09,599 --> 00:25:11,960
All we can do is do our best

302
00:25:12,319 --> 00:25:13,839
to protect the people we love.

303
00:25:14,559 --> 00:25:17,359
Helen, your coach and teammates

304
00:25:17,359 --> 00:25:19,000
seeing you like this today

305
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,480
would surely be proud of you.

306
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:23,480
Because I promised them

307
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:26,279
I'd never back down, no matter what.

308
00:25:26,839 --> 00:25:27,839
We'll take off now.

309
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:31,480
Quick, over there!

310
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:37,839
Come, I'd like to propose a toast

311
00:25:38,519 --> 00:25:40,599
to thank you for helping with the class.

312
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:41,839
It was a great success. Thank you.

313
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:44,960
Cheers!

314
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:45,839
Besides that,

315
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:48,599
thank you to Uncle Qu for this feast.

316
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,319
Thank you, Captain.

317
00:25:50,319 --> 00:25:50,839
Thank you, Captain.

318
00:25:50,839 --> 00:25:51,480
Thank you.

319
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:52,440
I'll take the credit for that,

320
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,480
but Anda,

321
00:25:54,039 --> 00:25:55,759
there's no need to be so polite with us.

322
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:57,880
Come on,

323
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:04,960
eat up, dig in!

324
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:05,400
So, Anda,

325
00:26:05,559 --> 00:26:07,359
how are the trainees doing lately?

326
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,359
They learn very fast.

327
00:26:09,559 --> 00:26:10,880
They've really improved a lot.

328
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:12,839
In Antilocaris, the capital of Supedo,

329
00:26:12,839 --> 00:26:14,000
the Phase Two oil pipeline project

330
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,640
bidding conference is about to begin.

331
00:26:16,079 --> 00:26:17,240
China's Zhonggang Group

332
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:18,839
has sent delegates to join the bid.

333
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:20,759
According to informed sources,

334
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:22,759
they have also brought in Zhong An

335
00:26:22,759 --> 00:26:23,920
as their security consultant

336
00:26:23,920 --> 00:26:26,279
to provide full security services.

337
00:26:26,839 --> 00:26:28,160
Given the worrying security situation

338
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:29,400
in Antilocaris,

339
00:26:29,559 --> 00:26:30,599
this could potentially become

340
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:32,680
a major advantage for Zhonggang's bid.

341
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,759
Help me wipe this down.

342
00:26:44,799 --> 00:26:45,680
Be careful.

343
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:48,559
Put that planter over here.

344
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:50,240
Everyone, keep a sharp eye out.

345
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:51,759
Nothing can go wrong, got it?

346
00:26:53,279 --> 00:26:54,279
What are you doing here?

347
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:58,039
You're in charge of this exhibition?

348
00:26:58,519 --> 00:26:59,319
What about you?

349
00:26:59,519 --> 00:27:01,160
I'm in charge of security.

350
00:27:01,480 --> 00:27:04,559
But the sheet said Shen Yu.

351
00:27:04,559 --> 00:27:05,880
I wrote that sheet.

352
00:27:06,359 --> 00:27:07,200
Then where's Shen Yu?

353
00:27:07,559 --> 00:27:09,000
He's briefing my dad on work.

354
00:27:11,039 --> 00:27:12,839
Mr. Feng will be here soon.

355
00:27:12,839 --> 00:27:14,759
Is the lounge ready?

356
00:27:14,759 --> 00:27:17,200
Have the coffee and tea ready too.

357
00:27:18,319 --> 00:27:20,319
A VIP of mine is about to arrive.

358
00:27:20,319 --> 00:27:21,599
I'm going to greet him now.

359
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:24,359
Aside from running the exhibition,

360
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:27,200
you're also acting as a greeter?

361
00:27:27,279 --> 00:27:28,200
To receive Mr. Feng.

362
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:29,200
Let me tell you,

363
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,319
that Mr. Feng is filthy rich,

364
00:27:33,319 --> 00:27:34,640
but he's a 60-year-old man

365
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,720
with quite an eccentric temper.

366
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:36,759
Watch yourself around him.

367
00:27:39,039 --> 00:27:40,240
I'm serious.

368
00:27:45,279 --> 00:27:46,000
This way, please.

369
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,880
Hello, Mr. Feng.

370
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,200
I'm An Da from Plato Hotel.

371
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,359
Hello, Ms. An.

372
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,000
How about I take you

373
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,480
to the lounge to rest for a bit,

374
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,480
and then we head to the exhibition hall?

375
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:54,279
That won't be necessary.

376
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:55,599
Just take me to the exhibition hall.

377
00:27:55,599 --> 00:27:56,480
All right. This way, please.

378
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,480
Please.

379
00:28:08,559 --> 00:28:10,079
Our hotel's lighting

380
00:28:10,079 --> 00:28:11,759
can accommodate different requirements.

381
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:13,160
The one you're looking at

382
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:15,359
is ideal for displaying jewelry.

383
00:28:16,359 --> 00:28:18,440
It brings out the jewelry's brilliance.

384
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,000
Still, I feel

385
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:22,480
the lighting might be a bit too dim.

386
00:28:23,119 --> 00:28:24,200
Actually, I think...

387
00:28:25,119 --> 00:28:26,359
What are you staring at?

388
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,839
Got a crush on An Da?

389
00:28:28,839 --> 00:28:29,680
What? No way.

390
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,160
I just think that guy seems suspicious.

391
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,319
It just gives me a bad feeling.

392
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,240
All right.

393
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,559
Let's check out that side.

394
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:37,359
How is he suspicious?

395
00:28:37,359 --> 00:28:39,000
He looks completely normal to me.

396
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:41,359
You're just jealous.

397
00:28:41,359 --> 00:28:42,680
If you like her, ask her out.

398
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:44,039
Why are you dragging your feet?

399
00:28:44,039 --> 00:28:45,000
Cut the crap.

400
00:28:45,559 --> 00:28:46,759
Trade shifts with me tonight.

401
00:28:46,799 --> 00:28:48,359
I'm worried about An Da heading home alone.

402
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:50,839
See? You said you weren't interested.

403
00:28:51,359 --> 00:28:52,680
You totally like her.

404
00:28:54,039 --> 00:28:55,359
Tonight, right?

405
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:57,720
No can do.

406
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,599
Bailing out when it counts.

407
00:29:01,799 --> 00:29:04,640
No, if I can't, Shen Yu can!

408
00:29:04,839 --> 00:29:06,039
Give him a shot.

409
00:29:06,079 --> 00:29:06,880
He's free.

410
00:29:13,359 --> 00:29:14,519
Go catch up to her, hurry!

411
00:29:14,519 --> 00:29:15,559
Don't just stand here.

412
00:29:17,680 --> 00:29:18,599
Such a slowpoke.

413
00:29:19,640 --> 00:29:21,960
Zhonggang Group, doing the construction,

414
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:25,000
has signed a security contract with us.

415
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:28,680
For security work during construction,

416
00:29:29,279 --> 00:29:31,200
we're feeling immense pressure.

417
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:35,359
That's why we're asking for your help.

418
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:36,680
Zhong An needs you.

419
00:29:37,799 --> 00:29:39,200
I know what you're after.

420
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:41,839
Hades is guilty of heinous crimes.

421
00:29:42,000 --> 00:29:43,000
As far as I know,

422
00:29:43,279 --> 00:29:45,279
Interpol is already tracking him.

423
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:48,799
His arrest is just a matter of time.

424
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,000
Think about it.

425
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:52,000
Given the security situation in Supedo

426
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,240
and its political climate,

427
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:56,160
no matter who builds projects there,

428
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,480
Hades won't simply stand by.

429
00:29:58,559 --> 00:30:00,279
He's bound to cause trouble and sabotage.

430
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:02,200
And since you want to catch him,

431
00:30:03,319 --> 00:30:06,000
perfect for Silent Protectors to join us.

432
00:30:10,759 --> 00:30:12,200
There's no rush to answer.

433
00:30:12,599 --> 00:30:14,400
Think it over before getting back to me.

434
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:15,839
All right. Goodbye.

435
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:38,200
Anda, my friend, for a head teacher,

436
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,640
you really have no sense of time.

437
00:30:39,720 --> 00:30:40,759
I was just about to hail a cab.

438
00:30:40,759 --> 00:30:41,319
No need.

439
00:30:41,319 --> 00:30:42,640
Unless you can catch a ride with Rossi,

440
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,240
nothing's faster than my car.

441
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:47,000
Thanks for waiting for me.

442
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,759
Do you know what this is for?

443
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:28,480
It's an anemometer.

444
00:31:28,599 --> 00:31:30,359
It shows wind direction and speed.

445
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:44,000
The lowest price I can give you

446
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,480
is five thousand.

447
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:47,599
How much? Five thousand?

448
00:31:48,200 --> 00:31:49,680
Why don't you just rob me, man?

449
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,880
Take it, take it. Forget it!

450
00:31:53,599 --> 00:31:55,400
This is a Japanese wind vane.

451
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,079
Japanese artillerymen

452
00:31:57,079 --> 00:31:59,200
used it to adjust artillery firing angles,

453
00:31:59,480 --> 00:32:02,200
making their strikes far more accurate

454
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,279
and much deadlier.

455
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,079
Three thousand yuan.

456
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:10,000
It's just an accessory.

457
00:32:10,079 --> 00:32:11,359
Three thousand is already generous.

458
00:32:11,359 --> 00:32:12,759
Deal or not? If not, I'm leaving.

459
00:32:13,519 --> 00:32:14,319
Deal.

460
00:32:17,079 --> 00:32:17,759
That's more like it.

461
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,279
Looking for me?

462
00:32:26,559 --> 00:32:27,359
N-No, not really.

463
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,759
It's... it's just that...

464
00:32:28,799 --> 00:32:29,759
You want this, right?

465
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,759
Add two hundred and it's yours.

466
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,799
What, two hundred is too much?

467
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,759
I just knocked off two grand for you.

468
00:32:37,799 --> 00:32:38,880
If not, forget about it.

469
00:32:39,279 --> 00:32:40,960
Fine, take it, take it!

470
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,000
Here, scan the code.

471
00:32:49,519 --> 00:32:50,240
Sent.

472
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,200
Now hand it over to me.

473
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:53,519
Bro!

474
00:32:54,119 --> 00:32:55,440
Bro, wait...

475
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,720
What's your number?

476
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,200
How about we add each other on WeChat?

477
00:32:58,599 --> 00:33:00,039
Everyone around here calls me Abu.

478
00:33:00,039 --> 00:33:01,400
What should I call you, bro?

479
00:33:01,759 --> 00:33:02,960
By the way, bro,

480
00:33:02,960 --> 00:33:05,559
how did you know he'd sell it for 3,000?

481
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:09,160
Think about it. With a stall that big,

482
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:09,920
he put this item

483
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:11,440
in the most obscure spot,

484
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,759
and even covered it up.

485
00:33:13,039 --> 00:33:15,200
That means he didn't care about it.

486
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:15,759
And if he didn't care,

487
00:33:15,759 --> 00:33:17,640
he obviously didn't know what it's for.

488
00:33:17,759 --> 00:33:18,920
If he doesn't even know what it's for,

489
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:20,279
how could he possibly know its value?

490
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:23,559
Offering three thousand was being generous.

491
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:24,960
If I had said a hundred,

492
00:33:25,079 --> 00:33:26,759
he might have sold it anyway.

493
00:33:27,839 --> 00:33:29,039
I get it now!

494
00:33:29,039 --> 00:33:30,400
Bro, you have no idea.

495
00:33:30,559 --> 00:33:32,839
In this club, both the items and people

496
00:33:32,839 --> 00:33:34,000
are a mixed bag.

497
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:36,000
Sure, some items are genuine collectibles,

498
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:37,200
but there are plenty of fakes too.

499
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,559
Some people are true military buffs,

500
00:33:38,599 --> 00:33:40,039
while others are just merchants

501
00:33:40,319 --> 00:33:41,920
posing as enthusiasts.

502
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:42,759
You know what I mean?

503
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:46,759
Bro, did you hear?

504
00:33:46,839 --> 00:33:50,400
Rumor has it two vendors in Zones E3 and H

505
00:33:51,160 --> 00:33:53,559
used to do business in Iraq,

506
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:57,279
but quit the trade after a bad experience.

507
00:33:57,519 --> 00:33:58,319
Can you believe that?

508
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:03,680
Bro, how about this?

509
00:34:04,039 --> 00:34:05,960
Why don't you be my consultant?

510
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:08,559
With an eye like yours, if we team up,

511
00:34:08,559 --> 00:34:10,360
we can't go wrong.

512
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:14,079
Let me think about it.

513
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,199
Bro!

514
00:34:17,719 --> 00:34:18,880
What do you think, bro?

515
00:34:19,199 --> 00:34:21,400
German cavalry communication spec:

516
00:34:22,199 --> 00:34:24,559
the DKW NZ359.

517
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:26,239
Not bad. Not bad at all.

518
00:34:26,239 --> 00:34:27,360
You bet!

519
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,760
I know a buyer looking for one right now.

520
00:34:29,760 --> 00:34:31,199
The profit margin is huge.

521
00:34:31,559 --> 00:34:32,960
If we sell this,

522
00:34:33,119 --> 00:34:34,559
we can afford our own booth

523
00:34:34,599 --> 00:34:36,239
right here in the military club.

524
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:38,760
The only catch is,

525
00:34:39,239 --> 00:34:40,960
we have to restore it properly.

526
00:34:41,199 --> 00:34:43,400
The parts here might look like a mess,

527
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:45,199
but one thing I'm sure of, bro,

528
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:46,400
is that these parts

529
00:34:46,559 --> 00:34:49,400
are definitely a full set of bike parts.

530
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:52,679
Still, restoring it

531
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:54,159
to its 1944 look

532
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,760
is going to take some creativity.

533
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:08,599
What's wrong, Anda?

534
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:10,559
You seemed down all day.

535
00:35:12,239 --> 00:35:15,559
Not really, just a bit tired from the day.

536
00:35:17,719 --> 00:35:18,519
True.

537
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,800
You work at the hotel during the day,

538
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:22,400
and oversee the training class at night.

539
00:35:23,239 --> 00:35:25,559
Honestly, for theory classes like today's,

540
00:35:25,559 --> 00:35:26,840
you didn't have to come at all.

541
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:29,559
Thanks for taking me home.

542
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,239
Don't mention it.

543
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,559
What are friends for?

544
00:35:32,679 --> 00:35:34,280
I wish I could bring you home every day.

545
00:35:35,239 --> 00:35:36,960
All right, go get some rest.

546
00:35:37,119 --> 00:35:37,920
Bye.

547
00:35:45,719 --> 00:35:46,519
Um...

548
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:47,559
What's wrong?

549
00:35:47,559 --> 00:35:48,840
I forgot my keys.

550
00:35:51,039 --> 00:35:51,840
Come on.

551
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:58,880
Let's go, I'll help you.

552
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:11,760
Turns out a Security Officer like you

553
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:12,880
knows how to break things too.

554
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:14,480
This isn't breaking things.

555
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:15,599
Think about it.

556
00:36:15,599 --> 00:36:16,639
What if a bad guy

557
00:36:16,639 --> 00:36:18,559
locked you in this room, right?

558
00:36:18,599 --> 00:36:19,800
Don't scare me.

559
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:22,400
Your lock's security grade is too low.

560
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:23,599
Grade?

561
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:26,000
I only know about Class B and C.

562
00:36:26,239 --> 00:36:28,280
I don't know any other differences.

563
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:32,280
All right, it's open.

564
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:36,880
The door's open, but the lock is ruined.

565
00:36:37,119 --> 00:36:38,000
I'll call someone later

566
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,559
to replace it.

567
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:40,599
Okay.

568
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:42,760
I'll take off then.

569
00:36:44,519 --> 00:36:45,320
Wait...

570
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:46,719
The door is already open.

571
00:36:46,719 --> 00:36:48,239
Why don't you come in and keep me company?

572
00:36:48,239 --> 00:36:49,800
We have to wait anyway, right?

573
00:36:51,719 --> 00:36:52,559
No, I...

574
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:54,760
I-I'll get you some water.

575
00:36:55,199 --> 00:36:56,719
I have all kinds of drinks.

576
00:36:56,719 --> 00:36:57,599
Come on, come inside.

577
00:36:57,719 --> 00:36:58,519
All right.

578
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:10,639
I don't think this will work.

579
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:13,280
I've decided to find an expert.

580
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:24,760
A true master.

581
00:37:25,199 --> 00:37:26,000
Yeah.

582
00:37:28,599 --> 00:37:29,559
All right, it's getting late.

583
00:37:29,599 --> 00:37:30,559
I should head back now.

584
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:31,840
Still got work tomorrow.

585
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:32,880
You get some rest early, too.

586
00:37:35,119 --> 00:37:36,760
This bike is such a pain to deal with.

587
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:37,679
See you.

588
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:48,760
See what they're saying about the Captain.

589
00:37:50,119 --> 00:37:51,960
I've already seen this.

590
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:54,199
Here, have some coffee first.

591
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,079
Thanks.

592
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:57,559
Don't mention it.

593
00:38:01,039 --> 00:38:03,400
Say, if our Captain

594
00:38:03,519 --> 00:38:04,719
started teaching shooting classes,

595
00:38:04,719 --> 00:38:06,000
how many fans would he get?

596
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,920
You're turning our training course

597
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,840
into a charity project.

598
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:14,400
Shen Yu, what are you doing here?

599
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:17,199
I just clocked off when Boss Xiang called,

600
00:38:17,320 --> 00:38:18,239
telling me to change the lock.

601
00:38:19,239 --> 00:38:20,800
Here, the tools are right here.

602
00:38:21,559 --> 00:38:22,199
Take them.

603
00:38:22,199 --> 00:38:22,840
Okay.

604
00:38:27,239 --> 00:38:30,360
What do you think of our training class's

605
00:38:30,719 --> 00:38:31,800
results so far?

606
00:38:33,679 --> 00:38:34,480
Results?

607
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:48,199
Hello.

608
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:53,159
You're He Ying, right?

609
00:38:54,159 --> 00:38:55,000
Yes.

610
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,639
Why haven't you left yet?

611
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:58,559
I'm leaving right away.

612
00:39:05,079 --> 00:39:06,400
What happened to your hand?

613
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:09,719
It's nothing.

614
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:12,800
During today's combat training,

615
00:39:13,159 --> 00:39:14,599
I bumped it by accident.

616
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:17,760
Why didn't you say so? I have medicine.

617
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:19,039
Let me take care of it.

618
00:39:19,039 --> 00:39:20,039
Otherwise, your husband will...

619
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:21,840
No, really, it's fine.

620
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,079
I'll take care of it when I get home.

621
00:39:28,519 --> 00:39:29,639
Is something wrong?

622
00:39:31,039 --> 00:39:33,440
When I saw you leaving the hotel today,

623
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:34,960
you seemed fine.

624
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:36,400
Why do you seem off now you're back?

625
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:40,480
What are you protecting in security work?

626
00:39:42,079 --> 00:39:44,760
Those who can't protect themselves.

627
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:50,239
Then when danger strikes,

628
00:39:50,239 --> 00:39:53,000
isn't self-protection more important?

629
00:39:54,719 --> 00:39:57,559
You could say that, before danger strikes.

630
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:59,400
Prevention is key, after all.

631
00:39:59,599 --> 00:40:02,480
Besides, the security measures we take

632
00:40:02,559 --> 00:40:04,679
are all designed with prevention in mind.

633
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:08,559
What if danger has already happened?

634
00:40:08,639 --> 00:40:12,400
Shouldn't we look at the exact situation

635
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:13,559
and solve it accordingly?

636
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:15,079
Right.

637
00:40:15,519 --> 00:40:17,480
Then... it's still too late.

638
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:18,599
What's too late?

639
00:40:19,199 --> 00:40:21,800
Well, that... that woman, she...

640
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:22,280
Excuse me.

641
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:22,920
Here.

642
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,559
The lock has been replaced.

643
00:40:25,679 --> 00:40:26,679
Here are the new keys.

644
00:40:26,679 --> 00:40:26,960
Thank you.

645
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:27,639
Thanks for your hard work.

646
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:28,679
No problem.

647
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:31,000
I won't disturb you two further.

648
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:32,079
I'll get going now.

649
00:40:32,639 --> 00:40:33,559
Wait a second, hold on.

650
00:40:33,719 --> 00:40:38,559
You two are heading the same way, right?

651
00:40:39,199 --> 00:40:40,000
Yeah.

652
00:40:42,079 --> 00:40:44,440
Why don't you leave with him?

653
00:40:44,440 --> 00:40:45,159
Come on, come on.

654
00:40:46,239 --> 00:40:47,199
I've got things to do.

655
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:48,360
You two head out first.

656
00:40:48,400 --> 00:40:49,039
Go on, get going.

657
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:50,760
Why does that sound so awkward from you?

658
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:51,639
It's fine, it's fine.

659
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,559
Just go on.

660
00:40:53,480 --> 00:40:54,280
Goodbye.

661
00:41:07,079 --> 00:41:08,559
The hotel and exhibition hall cameras

662
00:41:08,599 --> 00:41:09,559
has all been set up and tested.

663
00:41:09,559 --> 00:41:10,880
Make sure to check the fire exits

664
00:41:10,880 --> 00:41:12,000
and the conditions in the basement.

665
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:13,760
Got it. Don't worry.

666
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:14,840
I've already sent someone over.

667
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:15,480
Good.

668
00:41:17,719 --> 00:41:18,559
Young Mr. Xiang.

669
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:19,320
Mr. Xiao.

670
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:20,559
Shen Yu.

671
00:41:21,639 --> 00:41:22,559
What a coincidence.

672
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:25,159
Not long ago in Antilocaris,

673
00:41:25,159 --> 00:41:26,400
I saw you off.

674
00:41:26,599 --> 00:41:28,159
And now we run into each other here.

675
00:41:28,159 --> 00:41:29,239
What a small world!

676
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:30,800
You're too kind, Mr. Xiao.

677
00:41:31,119 --> 00:41:32,199
What are you up to here?

678
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:35,480
Plato is one of Zhong An's clients,

679
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:37,480
and this project happens to be

680
00:41:37,480 --> 00:41:38,559
one of Plato's key initiatives.

681
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:39,440
So,

682
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:41,760
we at Zhong An will make sure

683
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:43,840
all security measures are in place.

684
00:41:44,599 --> 00:41:47,239
No wonder everything is so well-organized.

685
00:41:47,239 --> 00:41:49,000
Turns out you're the ones in charge.

686
00:41:50,199 --> 00:41:51,440
That's wonderful.

687
00:41:51,599 --> 00:41:53,440
I can rest easy knowing you're on it.

688
00:41:53,559 --> 00:41:54,360
Impressive.

689
00:41:54,840 --> 00:41:57,039
All right, I have things to attend to.

690
00:41:57,199 --> 00:41:58,440
Go ahead with your work.

691
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,480
I won't interrupt you any longer.

692
00:41:59,480 --> 00:41:59,760
See you later.

693
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:00,559
See you later, Mr. Xiao.

694
00:42:00,719 --> 00:42:01,960
See you later, Mr. Xiang.

695
00:42:03,280 --> 00:42:04,079
Xiang Bei.

696
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:07,800
The bomb containment vessel is in place.

697
00:42:08,079 --> 00:42:09,880
All checks have been completed.

698
00:42:11,480 --> 00:42:12,280
It's just that...

699
00:42:12,719 --> 00:42:13,519
What is it?

700
00:42:15,280 --> 00:42:16,559
Since returning home,

701
00:42:16,599 --> 00:42:17,800
I've noticed the name Zhong An

702
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:19,400
doesn't carry the weight it did in Africa.

703
00:42:20,800 --> 00:42:21,599
What do you mean?

704
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:23,519
I didn't mean anything by it.

705
00:42:23,519 --> 00:42:25,440
It's fine. Actually, I thought the same.

706
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:28,639
Zhong An has a huge reputation overseas,

707
00:42:28,639 --> 00:42:30,559
but doesn't seem very competitive at home.

708
00:42:31,119 --> 00:42:33,000
Still, I think that's normal.

709
00:42:33,199 --> 00:42:34,880
Our domestic public security is good,

710
00:42:35,199 --> 00:42:36,440
focusing mainly on prevention.

711
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:39,360
So lately I've been thinking

712
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:40,400
about bringing it up with my dad.

713
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:42,360
Some things definitely need to change.

714
00:42:42,360 --> 00:42:43,079
Change?

715
00:42:43,360 --> 00:42:44,159
Change how?

716
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:46,239
We can't just take the overseas playbook

717
00:42:46,239 --> 00:42:47,199
and apply it domestically.

718
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:48,960
Oh, you're all here.

719
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:52,360
I won't disturb you then.

720
00:42:58,199 --> 00:42:59,000
What's with him?

721
00:42:59,760 --> 00:43:01,159
Why is he suddenly so cheerful?

722
00:43:01,760 --> 00:43:02,559
What happened?

723
00:43:05,519 --> 00:43:06,320
That's a secret.

724
00:43:06,599 --> 00:43:08,159
Come on, tell us what's going on!

725
00:43:09,280 --> 00:43:10,360
Last night,

726
00:43:10,639 --> 00:43:13,400
someone got kicked out by An Da.

727
00:43:13,519 --> 00:43:14,320
Yeah.

728
00:43:14,440 --> 00:43:17,320
Someone got thrown out

729
00:43:17,320 --> 00:43:18,360
with an angry glare.

730
00:43:19,239 --> 00:43:20,559
Let me tell you,

731
00:43:20,719 --> 00:43:22,039
that's where you're clueless.

732
00:43:22,239 --> 00:43:24,000
A woman's heart is a needle in the sea.

733
00:43:24,119 --> 00:43:27,039
To figure her out, you need serious game.

734
00:43:27,559 --> 00:43:28,400
See ya.

735
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:31,000
Zuo Feichen, where are you going?

736
00:43:31,559 --> 00:43:32,599
He has the day off today.
